CHAPTER.VERS:
And they brought forth the he goats [for] the sin offering before the king and the congregation; 

          That is, the king and the elders, as in (Lev_4:15) for they who offered a sin offering must lay their hands on it, to signify that they had deserved that death, and also that they consecrated it to God to be sanctified by it, (Exo_29:10).
         and they laid their hands upon them:
